  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "DSH Simple Worktree Plus",
      "text": "**English** | [简体中文](README.zh.md)\n\n`@xzhi/dsh-simple-worktree-plus` is a Git Worktree management plugin for [DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-Harness).\n\nThis project continues the open-source work of [alpacachen/dsh-worktree](https://github.com/alpacachen/dsh-worktree). Thank you to the original project for the Worktree creation, Workspace registration, and isolated-session foundation."
    },
    {
      "section": "DSH Simple Worktree Plus",
      "text": "The Plus edition extends deletion policies, management entry points, and per-Workspace management for easier multi-branch task work and cleanup."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add @xzhi/dsh-simple-worktree-plus\n```\n\nRestart `dsh web` and refresh the page after installation or upgrade."
    },
    {
      "section": "Usage",
      "text": "- Create a Worktree from a new session in a Git Workspace.\n- Use **Worktree Management** in the sidebar to view Worktrees across all Workspaces.\n- Right-click a Workspace and select **Worktree Management** to scan only that Workspace.\n- When deleting a Worktree, use the confirmation options to delete its Git branch as well."
    },
    {
      "section": "Plus features",
      "text": "| Feature | Description |\n| --- | --- |\n| Branch handling on deletion | Optionally delete the corresponding Git branch when deleting a Worktree. |\n| Delete branch by default | **Also delete the Git branch** is enabled by default. |\n| Force-delete unmerged branches | Use `git branch -D` for unmerged branches; enabled by default and should be used carefully. |\n| Top-bar entry | Opens Worktree Management beside the top Workspace picker. |\n| Sidebar entry | Opens Worktree Management immediately above **Settings** in the sidebar. |\n| Scoped Workspace management | Right-click a Workspace to open Worktree Management scoped to that Workspace only. |\n| Deletion default preferences | Configure the default checkbox states used the next time a deletion dialog opens. |\n| Independent plugin identity | Uses the `@xzhi/dsh-simple-worktree-plus` package and DSH plugin identity. |"
    },
    {
      "section": "Warning",
      "text": "Force-deleting an unmerged Git branch permanently removes commits that are only on that local branch. Push, merge, or otherwise back up important work before deleting it."
    }
  ],
